        "title": "Sandy Frank! Sandy Frank! We'll not see his like again!",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/215037/Sandy-Frank-Sandy-Frank-Well-not-see-his-like-again",
        "content_text": "He was the producer of Name That Tune and involved with the development of The Dating Game. He imported and had localized into English the early anime Ninja Science Team Gatchaman, into Battle of the Planets. He was the benefactor of an orphanage in Cannes. But the name <a href=\"https://deadline.com/2026/11/sandy-frank-dead-name-that-tune-producer-1237211476/\"><i>Sandy Frank</i></a> is perhaps best known for bringing to the US a number of Japanese live action shows like Star Wolf and Mighty Jack, in addition to the Gamera monster movies, that would serve as the basis for several classic episodes of Mystery Science Theater 3000. Farewell, Sandy Frank, may flights of feathered cyborg ninja kids and giant fiery turtles sing thee to thy rest. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7g73C6EG17c&list=PLpsWT_Z9m35mJeHB76puPgOE1w4dkPe3Q\">Episodes of Name That Tune on Youtube</a>. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLLhOnau-tupQ8b6e96_z36YhzNG9-S8PK\">Episodes of Battle of the Planets (and some extra assorted junk) on Youtube</a>. Inside you'll find classic Sandy Frank MST3K episodes.<br/><br/>Episodes are \"as broadcast,\" with commercials and Comedy Central station bumpers intact.\nMST3K 302 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RqJCDROb0n0\">GAMERA</a>\nMST3K 304 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-y92HmRY-bA\">GAMERA VS. BARUGON</a>\nMST3K 306 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZDIdUD_0YRg\">TIME OF THE APES</a>\nMST3K 306 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udgXEfdBqTs\">TIME OF THE APES</a> (1991 Turkey Day)\nMST3K 308 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLxmoQYXovM\">GAMERA VS. GAOS</a>\nMST3K 310 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRIfjAlX-o4\">FUGITIVE ALIEN</a> (1991 Turkey Day)\nMST3K 312 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OAVsN2iLXrw\">GAMERA VS. GUIRON</a>\nMST3K 312 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cM5R7a53GHw\">GAMERA VS. GUIRON</a> (1992 Turkey Day)\nMST3K 314 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_KW7LICnd0\">MIGHTY JACK</a>\nMST3K 316 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nDpVGdx58bI\">GAMERA VS. ZIGRA</a>\nMST3K 318 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wFkqHj8bqPg\">STAR FORCE: FUGITIVE ALIEN II</a>\nMST3K 318 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=laNljUtOI7k\">STAR FORCE: FUGITIVE ALIEN II</a> (1993 Turkey Day)\n\nExtra: MST3K 1307 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwC09ZyethM\">GAMERA VS. JIGER</a> (not as-broadcast since it was never broadcast, and not from Sandy Frank but generally of a piece with the other Gamera movies)\n\nKTMA episodes (warning! very early!)\nMST3K K03 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zDpIMWarGYg\">STAR FORCE: FUGITIVE ALIEN II</a>\nMST3K K04 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f9D__CeFmLk&pp=0gcJCSsMAYcqIYzv\">GAMERA VS. BARUGON</a>\nMST3K K05 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0GZ-GaWuanQ\">GAMERA</a>\nMST3K K06 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VouJfNwPoXY\">GAMERA VS. GAOS</a>\nMST3K K07 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GFdpX4myNU4\">GAMERA VS. ZIGRA</a>\nMST3K K08 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7r37EaogcRc\">GAMERA VS. GUIRON</a>\nMST3K K12 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yxJilFVqNIk\">FUGITIVE ALIEN</a>\nMST3K K14 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCMX84nbLGw\">MIGHTY JACK</a>\nMST3K K17 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=msryIQQ7KYg\">TIME OF THE APES</a>",
        "type": "Internet",
        "source": "MetaFilter"
