        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/03/epic-app-store.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The U.S. Supreme Court has officially scheduled oral arguments in Apple’s appeal in its long-running legal battle with Epic Games. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,epic-games\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077125\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/02/scotus-sets-hearing-date-for-apples-appeal-in-epic-games-case/#more-1077125\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
