        "title": "iOS 27.2 gives Shortcuts app these new and improved features",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/29/ios-27-2-gives-shortcuts-app-these-new-and-improved-features/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-shortcuts-app-ios-27-icon.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27.2 <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/apple-releases-ios-27-2-heres-whats-new/\">launched this week</a> with a variety of new features for <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/siri-ai-keeps-getting-better-heres-whats-new-in-ios-27-2/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1075884\">Siri AI</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/23/ios-27-2-makes-facetimes-best-new-feature-even-better/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1071182\">FaceTime</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/27/ios-27-2-adds-new-messages-feature-thats-already-a-favorite/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1072162\">Messages</a>, and more, plus a handful of improvements for the Shortcuts app. Here’s everything new in Shortcuts.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27,ios-27-2,shortcuts\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1076495\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/29/ios-27-2-gives-shortcuts-app-these-new-and-improved-features/#more-1076495\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
