        "title": "iOS 27.3 release date: Here’s when to expect new iPhone features",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/29/ios-27-3-release-date-heres-when-to-expect-new-iphone-features/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/ios-27-3-iphone-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple released iOS 27.2 this week with new features for <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/27/ios-27-2-adds-new-messages-feature-thats-already-a-favorite/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1072162\">Messages</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/siri-ai-keeps-getting-better-heres-whats-new-in-ios-27-2/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1075884\">Siri AI</a>, and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/28/ios-27-2-just-upgraded-apple-photos-in-two-ways-heres-whats-new/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1076236\">Photos</a>, plus an <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/27/ios-27-2-adds-new-app-icon-for-apple-music-more-design-updates/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1074046\">Apple Music rebrand</a> and more. But work on iOS 27.3 is already well underway, here’s when to expect the next big iPhone update.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27,ios-27-3\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1076486\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/29/ios-27-3-release-date-heres-when-to-expect-new-iphone-features/#more-1076486\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
