        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-monday-morning-agent-defining-the-tush-push/",
        "content_text": "“Tush push” never appears in our roughly 265,000 play descriptions from 2021 through the current season. Neither does “brotherly shove,” and “sneak” turns up only twice. So when we asked our AI analyst to tackle “Ban the Tush Push” in the October 26 episode of The Monday Morning Agent, we first had to define the [&#8230;]",
