        "title": "Practical Loop Engineering",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/practical-loop-engineering/",
        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Addy Osmani’s Elevate blog and is being republished here with the author’s permission. The way that I typically work is I have anywhere between five and ten agents working at the same time in parallel. There are going to be some tasks that I’m very happy to delegate fully [&#8230;]",
